# ChurchFi - Bradenton Gospel Tabernacle WiFi Portal

A modern React-based WiFi management portal for residential communities, featuring:

- **Resident Portal**: Free session timer, paid plan purchase, maintenance requests
- **Guest Portal**: Free WiFi with optional donation extension  
- **Admin Dashboard**: User management, voucher generation, events, property map
- **Property Map**: Interactive 2D/3D map with 76 units across Church (40), Block A (8), Block B (8), Trailer Park (20)
- **Security Cameras**: 6 camera feeds with live monitoring

## Tech Stack
- React + Vite
- Dark military aesthetic UI
- SVG-based interactive property map

## Setup
```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

## Demo Codes
- CHURCH24 - Day Pass
- BLESS724 - Week Pass  
- GRACE301 - Monthly Pass

